flowchart TD
    RENDER["AI artefact produced<br/>summary, ranking, parsed field, suggestion"]
    SURFACE{"Where did it land?"}
    SHOWN["Influence class SHOWN<br/>rendered to a decider"]
    ORDERED["Influence class ORDERED<br/>set the order or filter of the list"]
    FIELD["Influence class FIELD<br/>wrote a structured field a rule or human read"]
    CAND["Rendered to the candidate only<br/>TR-7: recorded, no employer taint"]
    UNKNOWN["Render not confirmed<br/>TR-8: resolves to SHOWN, resolution ASSUMED"]

    TRIPLE["Taint attached to the triple<br/>person + requisition or cycle + stage<br/>TR-1"]
    STICKY["Sticky forward through later stages<br/>of the same requisition, TR-2"]
    NOBACK["Never backwards in time,<br/>never to another requisition<br/>unless re-rendered, TR-3"]
    CONFIG["Disabling the feature does not clear<br/>taint already recorded, TR-4"]

    DEC{"Decision proposed<br/>on this person"}
    ADV{"Is it adverse?<br/>REJECT, KNOCKOUT, RATING,<br/>CALIBRATION_MOVE, PIP_START,<br/>TERMINATION_RECO, adverse RECO"}
    GATE["Confirmer gate, FR-T-D001<br/>named human + timestamp + reason"]
    SNAP["Snapshot composed in the<br/>commit transaction, FR-T-D002"]
    COMMIT["COMMITTED<br/>state change + decision record"]
    PLAIN["Recorded without the gate<br/>taint still stored for FR-T-D003 populations"]
    BULK["Bulk action: union of the batch's<br/>classes, TR-5; one record per person, FR-T-D015"]

    RENDER --> SURFACE
    SURFACE -->|Decider surface| SHOWN
    SURFACE -->|List order or filter| ORDERED
    SURFACE -->|Structured field| FIELD
    SURFACE -->|Candidate surface only| CAND
    SURFACE -->|Telemetry missing| UNKNOWN

    SHOWN --> TRIPLE
    ORDERED --> TRIPLE
    FIELD --> TRIPLE
    UNKNOWN --> TRIPLE
    TRIPLE --> STICKY --> NOBACK --> CONFIG --> DEC

    DEC --> ADV
    DEC --> BULK --> ADV
    ADV -->|Yes, and influence is not NONE| GATE --> SNAP --> COMMIT
    ADV -->|No, or influence is NONE| PLAIN --> COMMIT
